  Role: Assigned Teacher - set bearerToken to seed-tch-a1 token
  Needs: organization_id=seed-org-a, class_id=seed-org-a-class-1 (5 seeded SYNTHETIC_DEV profiles; default limit=25, max=100)
  Expected: 200 / Be1ManagedProfileListV1 (items, next_cursor string|null, active_profile_count >= items.length; 409 CONSENT_NOT_EFFECTIVE was removed by T-7e)
